cting and discovering works inspired by the greatest Italian masters. Every sound and visual detail is designed to draw you deep into the music, letting you experience Vivaldi like never before.\nA poetic and immersive experience, perfect for lovers of music, art, and virtual reality.\n", "short_description": "An immersive VR experience set to the notes of Vivaldi\u2019s Summer, among breathtaking natural landscapes and interactive paintings inspired by Italian masters."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vrschoolitalia.it/privacy-policy-app-vr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "UE5", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.vrschoolitalia.it/altri-progetti/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "10098018830228316"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1423007712037678"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1423007712037678"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1746114900, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1423007712037678"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "10098875063476026", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "909542411300174", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"n